1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,420
Sur certains menus,

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:03,400
le symbole euro a disparu.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,480
Juste 12.

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,800
Pas 12 euros.

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,440
Des chercheurs de Cornell ont testé trois

6
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:07,720
